      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mr.jj/{size}/5371_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-12-22T00:39:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey all! Long time lurker/player here, first time poster.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With Ambuscade's new advanced challenge mode, (and all of the new challenges are awesome!) I've played him a couple times while actually being <em>challenged (how ironic)</em>. Hence, I believe I found a loophole which I don't think has been posted here. If he is cloaked, and you destroy the cloaking device and it is replayed before he his turn (via vanish and an out-of-turn play), will he re-flip and become uncloaked as long as the cloaking device is in play?</p><p>Danké!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:05.835Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 2,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
