      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Hey all! Long time lurker/player here, first time poster.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With Ambuscade&#39;s new advanced challenge mode, (and all of the new challenges are awesome!) I&#39;ve played him a couple times while actually being <em>challenged (how ironic)</em>. Hence, I believe I found a loophole which I don&#39;t think has been posted here. If he is cloaked, and you destroy the cloaking device and it is replayed before he his turn (via vanish and an out-of-turn play), will he re-flip and become uncloaked as long as the cloaking device is in play?</p><p>Danké!</p>",
