      "id": 124147,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-12-22T01:34:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Sejixs\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sejixs/48/2392_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Sejixs:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I like to pretend when this happens that Ambuscade believes that he is actually invisible and is amazed at the fact that the heroes are punching him with such a great accuracy.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That is great.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Will second that challenge Ambuscade is awesome. &nbsp;Will replace the normal Ambuscade from now on, just a great change. &nbsp;Although if you get a good amount of devices in the trash and hit an Armed and dangerous it is ugly as heck with all the traps resolving and re-shuffling, it puts you on a weird timer, the more devices hit the trash the more likely Armed and Dangerous is going to crush you.</p>",
