      "created_at": "2014-12-22T16:54:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There was a scenario in which I played a game against Ambuscade in the Freedom Tower. Training Simulator was played, and we moved his cloaking device from the trash into play. I imagined Ambuscade inside a simulation in which he was cloaked, but everyone could see him just fine, since the simulation wasn't real. And he remained plugged into the machine, fighting the heroes at the same time.</p>",
