      "created_at": "2014-12-24T22:36:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm looking forward to seeing how well the traps work in the digital version of the game. &nbsp;While I like the idea of the mechanic, because the cards are curved slightly in opposite directions an overhand shuffle seems to frequently end up with traps accumulated at the bottom of the deck. &nbsp;Riffle shuffling is aggravating with a deck that small.</p>",
